/// Lifecycle states of a workflow execution.
///
/// `#running` is the only open state; the other four are terminal.
/// `#continued_as_new` marks a run that handed off to a fresh run of the
/// same workflow. Declared as a closed union so a `matchExhaustive:` over
/// `WorkflowExecution status` fails to compile when a state is added and
/// not handled.
///
///   exec status matchExhaustive: [
///     #running -> nil;
///     #completed -> exec result;
///     #failed -> self error: "failed";
///     #cancelled -> self error: "cancelled";
///     #continued_as_new -> nil
///   ]
type WorkflowStatus = #running | #completed | #failed | #cancelled | #continued_as_new
